The '''Venice coffeehouse''' is a café located in [[Venice, Italy]], which sells several types of coffee, alcoholic beverages, and cakes. [[Lok Lambert]], [[Sophie Casterwill]] and [[Cherit]] worked here for a short time as they were trying to earn money for plane tickets to [[:Category:Egypt|Egypt]]. {{source|All Work and No Pay}}

== History==
While Lok, Sophie, and Cherit were working here, one [[complaining customer|customer]] complained about their service because his double cappuccino was too cold for his tastes. Lok used a [[Boltflare]] [[spell]] on the drink, making the customer burn his tongue. The two were fired shortly thereafter. {{source|All Work and No Pay}}
